      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/3345-do-not-touch-2d-pocket\n\nRefresh the Do not touch 2D Pocket branch against current main.\n\nConflicts resolved (both sides kept where each added lines):\n- avoid.rs, mcp/tools.rs, docs/agents/mcp-tools.md, ui tests: the supported\n  list is 2D Pocket, 2D Offset, 3D Pocket, Face and Trace.\n- pocket_avoid.rs and machining2d/mod.rs: keep the #3345 avoid level plan\n  and port main's StartSide plan (#3316) through AvoidSource::Plain,\n  ring_plan, adaptive_passes_from, with_cleared_links and\n  pocket_avoid_started_on.\n- generate.rs: the Pocket entrance keeps pass_start and pre-drilled holes;\n  the avoid entrance now takes pass_start too.\n- rest2d.rs: keep emit_rest_avoid; main's emit_rest moved into it.\n\nNo refusal or safety rule is dropped.\n\nReview findings:\n- Finding 1 (before/after screenshots): status is in the PR body.\n- Finding 2 (Process change: yes): the PR body now has the line.\n- Finding 3 (branch refresh): done by this merge.\n\nRefs #3345\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
