      "message": "Refresh #3516 against current main; resolve eight conflicts (#3345)\n\nTwo merges of origin/main: 5721b0fff and 4dba7019d.\n\nConflicts resolved (both sides kept where each added lines):\n- crates/app/src/operation/types/avoid.rs, crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs,\n  docs/agents/mcp-tools.md, crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/do_not_touch.rs:\n  the supported set is 2D Pocket, 2D Offset, 3D Pocket, Face and Trace.\n- crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_avoid.rs and machining2d/mod.rs:\n  keep the #3345 avoid level plan; port main's StartSide plan (#3316)\n  through AvoidSource::Plain, ring_plan, adaptive_passes_from,\n  with_cleared_links and pocket_avoid_started_on.\n- crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs: the 2D Pocket entrance keeps\n  pass_start and the pre-drilled holes; the avoid entrance takes pass_start.\n- crates/motion/src/machining2d/rest2d.rs: keep emit_rest_avoid; main's\n  emit_rest moved into it.\nNo refusal or safety rule is lost: the overhead keep-out to\nclearance_z.max(z), the crossing-free arc check and the helix guards stay.\n\nGate: cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main PASS, 310 steps,\n0 failed, 0 stalled. Clippy clean on motion, app and ui.\n\nReview findings:\n- Finding 1 (before/after screenshots): not produced; the GUI capture was\n  skipped. It stays open, so the PR is not ready.\n- Finding 2 (Process change: yes): not applicable. The refreshed diff\n  changes no process file, so the line must not be added and\n  .claude/PROCESS_VERSION is not changed.\n- Finding 3 (branch refresh): done by the two merges above.\n\nRefs #3345\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
