        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-23T21:40:53Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/3345-do-not-touch-2d-pocket (keep both sides)\n\nThe \"Do not touch\" support list takes both sides: 2D Pocket (#3345) from\nthis PR, and 2D Adaptive (#3346) and Engrave (#3349) from main. The code,\nthe MCP tool text, docs/agents/mcp-tools.md and the tests agree.\n\nThe motion conflicts keep this PR's extraction of the per-level planning\ninto plan_avoid_level and the unified emit_rest_avoid, and fold main's\n#3567 ramp_starts plumbing through both. The overhead keep-out stays at\np.clearance_z.max(z), the PR's stricter choice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
